## Title: |cEECA2AFavorite Guild Cycler|r
## Description: Automatically rotates the displayed guild beneath your character nameplate across selected favorite guilds. Features smooth zero-scroll-reset PS5 Character Sheet controls, 5 rotation modes (Sequential, Reverse, Shuffle Bag, Priority Bias, Ping-Pong), Quick Guild Pin, PvP & Dungeon/Trial instance locks, Group Leader sync, and a 1-second API rate-limit safeguard. Created by Animosity with special credit to the guild CRY.
